Name: smooth swiping

3-Finger-Cube-Gesture v4.0: turn the cube smoothly with 3- or 4-finger left/right swipes, as
far as the fingers go (with InputActions; see README.md). Made against KDE Plasma 6.7.5's Desktop Cube.

